  "prefLabel": "Home 402.01 Initiation of Disciplinary Action",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Home 402.01 Initiation of Disciplinary Action. The board shall undertake misconduct investigations, settlements of misconduct allegations, or disciplinary hearings, in response to any information which reasonably suggests that a licensee has engaged in professional misconduct.\n\nSource. #9506, eff 7-8-09; ss by #12463, eff 1-23-18",
